        <ArticleTitle>A <i>self-supervised</i> EEG foundation model</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND">EEG decoding has long relied on hand-crafted features and small labeled datasets, which limits generalization across subjects and recording montages.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS">We pretrain a transformer on <sup>large</sup> unlabeled EEG corpora.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">The model improves downstream seizure detection by a wide margin.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
